---
import EditorialLayout from '../layouts/EditorialLayout.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../lib/paths';
---
<EditorialLayout title="Assessment - 46K" description="Our research and development approach to cognitive assessment in football.">
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="page-intro container"><p class="kicker">RESEARCH &amp; DEVELOPMENT</p><span class="line"></span><h1 class="serif">Assessment.</h1><p class="page-deck">More information. Better questions.</p><p class="prose">We are developing approaches to assess relevant cognitive abilities in football. The work is at an early stage, and validation is essential. Assessment should complement coaching, observation and match data.</p></section>
    <section class="content-band"><div class="container two-column"><h2 class="serif">From measurement<br />to development.</h2><div class="prose"><p>A score is a starting point for a conversation. Its value depends on what it measures, how reliably it does so, and whether it helps us understand a player in context.</p><p>Our aim is to connect responsible assessment with useful questions about learning, training and development. We do not claim that a cognitive test can determine who will become a professional footballer.</p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('explore/?category=ASSESS')}>Read our assessment thinking <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></div></div></section>
    <section class="page-close container"><p class="kicker">FOR COACHES, CLUBS &amp; RESEARCHERS</p><h2 class="serif">Help ask the next question.</h2><a class="button-link" href={sitePath('connect/')}>Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></section>
  </main>
</EditorialLayout>
